    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turbo Liar is a racing game set in the 70s and 80s in the reality of socialist Poland. It is a collection of memories from J\u00f3zek \u015aroda - the protagonist. Told at the christmas eve table. His stories start of consistent, but over time, they increasingly diverge from reality. He mostly recalls his alleged driving prowess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633880/extras/9a2465ab9de0f62d5793c61459cd2e0e.avif?t=1751721768\" data-has-big width=800 height=382 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, players have the opportunity to drive vintage cars from the Communist-era Poland (PRL). The entire action takes place in Bielsko-Bia\u0142a \u2013 a city with an industrial heritage. J\u00f3zek \u015aroda works at the Small-Engine Car Factory (FSM), so he knows cars like the back of his hand. His stories are colorful and full of action \u2013 but that's only part of the picture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633880/extras/c9608684d86a35e46279228583c61f66.avif?t=1751721768\" data-has-big width=800 height=400 /></span>J\u00f3zek\u2019s memories don\u2019t reveal any bad moments from that era \u2013 at least not on the surface. The driving routes offer shortcuts that visually stand in stark contrast to the world presented. They hide a reality that J\u00f3zek would rather forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633880/extras/8e20c92bfc8ea4b357deadd558aadc1d.avif?t=1751721768\" data-has-big width=800 height=382 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features races, time-based route challenges, drifting trials, and story-driven missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into his world and see what life was really like \u201cbehind the iron curtain.\u201d</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turbo Liar is a racing game set in the 70s and 80s in the reality of socialist Poland. It is a collection of memories from J\u00f3zek \u015aroda - the protagonist. Told at the christmas eve table. His stories start of consistent, but over time, they increasingly diverge from reality. He mostly recalls his alleged driving prowess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633880/extras/9a2465ab9de0f62d5793c61459cd2e0e.avif?t=1751721768\" data-has-big width=800 height=382 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, players have the opportunity to drive vintage cars from the Communist-era Poland (PRL). The entire action takes place in Bielsko-Bia\u0142a \u2013 a city with an industrial heritage. J\u00f3zek \u015aroda works at the Small-Engine Car Factory (FSM), so he knows cars like the back of his hand. His stories are colorful and full of action \u2013 but that's only part of the picture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633880/extras/c9608684d86a35e46279228583c61f66.avif?t=1751721768\" data-has-big width=800 height=400 /></span>J\u00f3zek\u2019s memories don\u2019t reveal any bad moments from that era \u2013 at least not on the surface. The driving routes offer shortcuts that visually stand in stark contrast to the world presented. They hide a reality that J\u00f3zek would rather forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633880/extras/8e20c92bfc8ea4b357deadd558aadc1d.avif?t=1751721768\" data-has-big width=800 height=382 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features races, time-based route challenges, drifting trials, and story-driven missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into his world and see what life was really like \u201cbehind the iron curtain.\u201d</p>",
    "short_description": "Turbo Liar is a racing game set in the 70s and 80s in Bielsko-Bia\u0142a, Poland. Win all races around city, show your drifting skills and experience J\u00f3zek's stories. Sometimes you will need to escape Security Service, but your vehicle will never let you down. Find and explore all shortcuts on the map.",
